WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 0.3 · Start Here: Your Organisation Journey
Baseline organisational health check

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Rate each area honestly, with evidence, to see where to start.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Rate: not started, informal, documented, practised, reviewed.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Back every rating with one specific piece of evidence.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Ask a colleague to rate too, and compare.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Safeguarding: not started, although we plan activities with 12–17-year-olds. Finance: not started; Sari keeps receipts, no budget.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a baseline rating of your organisation and three priorities.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
